      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is a metaverse in Japan called Cluster that supports everything from PCVR to smartphones. If you want to incorporate smartphone users, and I think it is a very powerful move to incorporate smartphone users.\nVRC has a powerful programming tool called UDON, which allows us to create games with a fairly high degree of freedom for the world.\nCluster has not yet reached the UDON level of functionality, but there is no guarantee that Cluster will not catch up.",
